{
  "_comment": "Rendered per watched dir into .watcher/settings.research.json for research turns, which run in the experiment dir with bypassPermissions. Looser than settings.json: research turns may commit, push branches, open PRs and install into the project env. `watch start` appends Edit/Write denies for research.control_files. Deny rules hold even under bypassPermissions.",
